+++ b/CHANGELOG-v0.9.4.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@
+NaturalDex v0.9.4 — Audit + Sister Version Fallback
+
+- Adds sister-version fallback, enabled by default.
+- Preserves the real origin version; it never rewrites a sister-version encounter as the current version.
+- Supports paired editions from Gen 1 through Scarlet/Violet; standalone titles have no sister fallback.
+- Adds batch identity audit for accidental duplicate PID+EC values.
+- Living Dex official Mystery Gifts now also create EventReceiptPlan entries for Wonder Record history when enabled.
+- Keeps strict per-Pokémon LegalityAnalysis, preflight clone, automatic backup, transactional commit, and rollback.
+- Report explicitly marks Pokémon sourced from the sister version.
+- No HOME tracker fabrication or online-detection bypass behavior is implemented.
